OL,3,ANew White House press secretary says
OL,4,AGreece envoy Kimberly Guilfoyle asked
OL,5,Ato resign
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump's new White House Press
OL,8,FSecretary Katie Zacharia has given her
OL,9,Ffirst news conference
OL,11,FAsked about reports Trump could fire
OL,12,FKimberly Guilfoyle, his son's former
OL,13,Ffiancee, as ambassador to Greece,
OL,14,FZacharia confirms Guilfoyle has been
OL,15,Fasked to resign
OL,17,FZacharia began her briefing by saying
OL,18,FTrump delivered a blockbuster rally in
OL,19,FOhio last night, crediting his America
OL,20,FFirst agenda "and one of my favourites,
OL,21,Fsecure borders"
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
