OL,3,ANew White House press secretary says
OL,4,AGreece envoy Kimberly Guilfoyle asked
OL,5,Ato resign
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe says Trump is planning a "Midterm
OL,8,Fblitz" of campaigning as he visits
OL,9,FGeorgia, Kentucky and Florida
OL,11,FThe 42-year-old political strategist is
OL,12,Fa frequent fixture on conservative
OL,13,Fchannels, and has been active in
OL,14,FRepublican politics for most of her
OL,15,Fadult life
OL,17,FZacharia's predecessor, Karoline
OL,18,FLeavitt, left the job to spend more
OL,19,Ftime with her children and has since
OL,20,Ftaken a job at Fox News
